        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana 88GBL4224, \"L\" Shaped 88 Series Left Grab Bar</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nMade with the attention to quality for which Deltana is known, this solid brass grab bar is available satin nickel and polished chrome finishes. The modern style of the 88 series L shaped bathroom grab bar allows it to look good while still being functional; and it is great for any contemporary setting. This safety bar measures 42\" by 24\".\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-88GRL42-specifications.gif?v=1704442275\" width=\"278\" height=\"304\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana 88GBL4224 42\" x 24\"Grab Bar Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available:\r\n<br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/42-x-24-inch-right-l-shaped-grab-bar-deltana-88gbr4224\"><b>88 Series L Shaped Right Grab Bar</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nShop more of the <a href=\"/search?type=product&q=Deltana 88 Series\"><b>Deltana 88 Series Bathroom Accessories</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the 88 Solid Brass L Shaped Safety Grab Bar:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Top Length: 43\"</li>\r\n<li>Top Length c.c.: 41-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Bottom Length: 25\"</li>\r\n<li>Bottom Length c.c.: 23-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 3-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection From Wall to Bar: 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Mount Diameter: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-88GBL4224.pdf?v=1691095386\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana 88GBL4224 42\" x 24\"Grab Bar Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Sold Individually.</b> Package includes: 1 grab bar, mounting screw cover, and all necessary mounting screws.\r\n</p>",
